[4.176761, "o", "9m\u001b[1X\u001b[38;5;252m\r\n                                         \u001b[39m\u001b[1X\u001b[38;5;252m\r\n                                         \u001b[39m\u001b[1X\u001b[38;5;252m\r\n                                         \u001b[39m\u001b[1X\u001b[38;5;252m\r\n                                         \u001b[39m\u001b[1X\u001b[38;5;252m\r\n                                         \u001b[39m\u001b[1X\u001b[30m\u001b[1m\r\n─────────────────────────────────────────\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[1X\u001b[30m\u001b[1m\r\nF8 layout · F9 fullscreen\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[17X\u001b[30m\u001b[1m\r\nC-b Tab/← Sidebar · C-b → Pane 2\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[10X\u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[48;5;236m\u001b[1m\r\n?\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[48;5;236m Help\u001b[49m\u001b[30m\u001b[1m \u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[48;5;236mq\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[48;5;236m Quit\u001b[49m\u001b[30m\u001b[1m \u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[48;5;236mC-b d\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[48;5;236m Detach\u001b[49m\u001b[30m\u001b[1m \u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[48;5;236m+\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[48;5;236m More\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\u001b[9X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[1;44H ▐▛███▜▌   Claude Code v2.1.220\u001b[39m\u001b[52X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[2;44H▝▜█████▛▘  Opus 5 (1M context) · API Usage Billing\u001b[39m\u001b[33X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[3;44H  ▘▘ ▝▝    /demo/railmux-web-workspace-v1/projects/railmux\u001b[39m\u001b[25X\u001b[4;44H\u001b[83X\u001b[38;5;147m\n❯\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;252mIn railmux ssh, explain how a mouse-wheel event over an agent pane is served\u001b[39m\u001b[5X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[6;44H  from the fast client's local history overlay rather than forwarded upstream.\u001b[39m\u001b[5X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[7;44H  Point to the exact implementation symbols and one existing focused test that\u001b[39m\u001b[5X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[8;44H  directly asserts empty forwarded_input. Then suggest one small additional\u001b[39m\u001b[8X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[9;44H  assertion.\u001b[39m\u001b[71X\u001b[10;44H\u001b[83X\u001b[38;5;147m\n●\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[1mTrace SSH wheel ownership\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[56X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[1m\u001b[12;44H  \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;252mrailmux ssh — agent-pane wheel served locally, not forwarded upstream:\u001b[39m\u001b[11X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[13;44H  1. handle_terminal_part gets the SgrMouseEvent and dispatches to\u001b[39m\u001b[17X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[14;44H  LocalHistoryView.wheel.\u001b[39m\u001b[58X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[15;44H  2. wheel() resolves the pane via _route_at; a hit on an agent viewport scrolls\u001b[39m\u001b[3X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[16;44H  _HistoryViewport.offset and returns HistoryAction with render_history=True and\u001b[39m\u001b[3X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[17;44H  forwarded_input=b\"\" — no upstream input.\u001b[39m\u001b[41X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[18;44H  3. apply_history_action only sends upstream when action.forwarded_input is set;\u001b[39m\u001b[2X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[19;44H  empty means nothing reaches tmux. The overlay is painted client-side via\u001b[39m\u001b[9X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[20;44H  surface.paint_overlays.\u001b[39m\u001b[58X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[21;44H  4. This is a fast-client history overlay over bounded snapshots, not tmux copy-\u001b[39m\u001b[2X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[22;44H  mode; the implementation notes stock tmux WheelUpPane would enter copy-mode,\u001b[39m\u001b[5X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[23;44H  which is deliberately avoided.\u001b[39m\u001b[51X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[24;44H  Focused test: tests/test_fast_full_window.py::test_local_history_routes_sidebar_\u001b[39m\u001b[1X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[25;44H  immediately_and_owns_agent_wheel asserts agent_action.forwarded_input == b\"\".\u001b[39m\u001b[4X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[26;44H  Suggested addition: assert agent_action.render_history is True, proving the\u001b[39m\u001b[6X\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[27;44H  overlay rendered rather than merely dropping the event.\u001b[3